[Music]  summer 2019's almost upon us and with it  comes a slew of exciting anime shows for  everyone to enjoy this year's been a  strong year when it comes to smash hit  anime will 2019 summer match up to the  previous season's runs we can only wait  and see  we start off the list with bem at number  10.  bim's a unique case as it's a show  that's the second remake of a 1960s  anime with this one being for the  franchise's 50th anniversary i guess  this is the year of 1960s anime remakes  huh i mean we had dora road just now as  well the old super  [Music]  at number nine we have astra lost in  space  kenta shinohara otherwise known for his  best-selling title sket dance tries his  hand at sci-fi with astra lost in space  this story is set in a distant future  where space travels integrated with  everyday life for nine children on their  way to a planetary camp one fated trip  is anything but ordinary as they  encounter a light sphere that transports  them to an unknown planet the catch they  have to travel five thousand and twelve  light years to get back home despite the  sci-fi tank being associated with mecca  space drama and a lot of battles astra  lost in space is a sci-fi series that  doesn't have a lot of combat but what it  lacks in battles that most shonen jump  titles take pride in it makes up for  with a healthy dose of mystery and space  adventures let's come together to see  what adventures await the nine children  on their journey home  [Music]  eighth on this list is seven seeds  this anime takes place in the immediate  future where a giant meteorites collided  with earth and wiped out all living  organisms including mankind the  government had foreseen this so they  took measures to counter the worst case  scenario in particular was the project  seven seeds in which five sets of seven  young men and women were carefully  selected and placed into teams each  participant was then put under cryogenic  sleep in the hopes of preserving the  continued existence of mankind they'd be  released once conditions on earth had  become safe enough for them to live in  now the story begins in an unknown  number of years in the future when one  of the team awakens and learns that  their entire world and old life has been  destroyed and evolution has begun anew  if you're looking for a survival  adventure series with romance and  psychological aspects you should  definitely check this one out when it  hits netflix by the end of this month  danmachi's much awaited second season's  finally here and it takes the seventh  spot on the list  for the lower ones who prayed to the  gods for a continuation of belle's  journey with the hestia familia wait no  more it only took four years a multitude  of spin-offs ovas and a movie but fear  not for belle crannell and the rest of  the danmachi cast are here once more and  they're ready to take on whatever comes  their way this time group warfare takes  center stage in the war games proxy wars  that pit familias against each other  with the winner taking or at the end of  this arc the decisive collision with the  soma familia awaits bell and the hestia  familia will stop at nothing for victory  but so do their opponents with our  heroes overcome the biggest challenge  yet be sure to stay tuned as danmachi  returns this july  [Applause]  chinese hit king's avatar storms in at  number six with its anticipated second  season  not too long ago king's avatar took the  anime world by storm among the numerous  series that deal with video games rarely  do you see something focused on esports  with the narrative that today's youth  can really relate to king's avatar  captivated numerous anime fans and  aspiring pro gamers it's truly a fresh  change of pace to see amidst all those  stories that involve the characters  being transported into game worlds this  time we should expect a tournament arc  where yishu attempts to lead his new  team team happy to greater heights  expect a lot of exciting action and  drama as the team joins the challenger  league this second season should not  disappoint  at number five we have the much-awaited  ari furita  they sure kept everyone waiting for this  one didn't they after numerous delays  due to production issues it's finally  time for the anime community to witness  hajime nagumo's one-way trip to the  fantasy world if there are any  indications that the isikai train isn't  stopping anytime soon this show is  definitely one of them ari ferreta joins  the ranks of seasonal istakai that  features a weak and bullied character  who eventually rises and goes from  commonplace to the world's strongest  this time though ari furetta looks to  rise above the rest of its kin with its  darker tone and anti-hero main character  we'll see where white fox will go with  this adaptation of the hit light novel  fans of light novel adaptations  featuring overpowered main characters  and the harems shouldn't pass this one  up  fan favorite accelerator stars as the  fourth anime on the list a certain  scientific accelerator  right after we thought that was it for a  certain magical index jc staff comes at  us again with a spin-off starring one of  the franchise's most popular characters  the level 5 esper accelerator as he  continues his recovery at the hospital  accelerator enjoys a relatively peaceful  life a far cry from where we saw him in  index it all changes when he meets a  mysterious girl who has connections with  the last order the ride just doesn't end  for index fans though this time a  spin-off featuring the cool accelerators  something that you might want to check  out do take note though that the  experience is more complete if you've  already watched at least the first  season of index so what are you waiting  for start your own adventure into  academy city and the index series now  [Music]  just when you think you've seen it all  here comes fire force at number three  fire force brings us to a world where a  phenomenon known as spontaneous human  combustion turns humans into infernals  charcoal-like beings that spread death  and destruction  standing against the rampage of those  monsters is the special fire force a  group of trained individuals that have  the ability to harness the flames within  themselves however there's more than  meets the eye to these burning  monstrosities as shinra soon begins to  discover the truth behind the infernals  and the mysterious fire that killed his  family i've got to say soul eater's  writer atsushi okobo showcases his  creativity with the many unique powers  featured in the series with such an  engaging manga one can't help but be  excited for the anime series featuring  literal fire fighters the best part is  that the show seems to be in good hands  if the trailers are any indication to go  by for those craving more soul eater  black clover and similar fare this might  be the show for you  [Music]  shonen jumps dr stone takes second place  on the list  a bright light appears in the sky one  day and engulfs the world turning  everyone to stone and effectively  putting an end to civilization as we  know it high schooler taiji oki is among  the people consumed and turned into  stone but through sheer willpower he  manages to keep himself alive thousands  of years later awakening to a world of  statues taiji soon finds out that his  science enthusiast friend senku ishigami  also managed to escape petrification now  a new goal presents itself in front of  the two friends with their complimentary  talents they'll begin to rebuild  civilization from zero we've seen the  fallout of the world ending so many  times in anime already but the medium  just keeps throwing surprise after  surprise at us coming from someone who  hasn't read the manga dr stone really  does look quite interesting  survival in a primitive world story is  not something that you see every day and  i'm extremely interested in seeing how  this narrative actually plays out dr  stone rightfully takes his place among  the most anticipated series in this  upcoming season  [Music]  and at the top of this list we have  vinland saga the adaptation of makoto  yukimura's manga proudly takes the crown  of the number one most anticipated anime  of summer 2019. finland saga revolves  around the story of toffee and torson an  icelandic warrior driven by the fire of  vengeance against his father's killer  looking to exact revenge tawfin joins  the viking group of asgalad his father's  very killer with the promise of a future  duel against the person he swore  vengeance to  besides its brutal battles finland saga  also takes some cues from history and is  actually quite educational could this be  the start of a resurgence for historical  fiction only time will tell what we know  is that witch studios will have their  hands formed whether vin land saga could  replicate the magic of attack on titan  for which remains to be seen but as far  as we're concerned the hype is off the  charts especially for anime fans in the  west  [Music]  all in all summer 2019 looks to be  packed with shows for all kinds of  tastes i'm pretty sure that whatever  genre you enjoy you could find something  to look forward to any other shows that  you're excited for if so let us know  we'd love to hear from you so comment  below and like the video if you did and  subscribe for more anime related content  we also finally made it to 500k  subscribers yes thanks to everyone who  subscribed especially those who kept  supporting the channel even after the  changing content thank you so much your  support definitely definitely means a  lot i'll see you next time on vini tube  [Music]  you

